2. The detention order is founded on two incidents of theft, particulars of which are as under :
That on 18.6.1972 at about 17.00 hrs., you along with your associates stole away M S Angles worth about Rs. 1900/- from nine electric towers in the Beldanga-Gokarna 66 K.V. Line in Kandi, P.S. Area, seriously affecting maintenance of supplies and services of power and light which is essential to the community;
That on 26-7-72 at about 18.00 hrs. you along with your associates stole away M.S. Angles worth about Rs. 2000/- from ten electric towers of 66 K.V. Line near Jotophuiuria, P.S.Farakka, seriously affecting maintenance of supplies and services of power and light which is essential to the community.

